{"nodes":[{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_login_background_illustration","label":"Login Background Illustration (moonlit teal landscape with single light)","file_type":"image","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_full_bleed_viewport_composition","label":"Full-bleed 1920x1080 composition with xMidYMid slice cover scaling","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"A fixed 16:9 vector scene is scaled with preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" so it fills any login viewport as a non-repeating background without raster assets."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_night_sky_gradient","label":"Night sky linear gradient (sky)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Vertical stops from near-black #06141c through #0d3440 and #17676a to #2a8f87 create a dark top fading to a lighter horizon, keeping the center free for login form text."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_celestial_light_source","label":"Celestial light source (moon glow and disc)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"A radial glow centered at (1480,170) plus a small bright disc anchors the upper-right of the scene and motivates the teal lighting of the landscape."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_star_field","label":"Scattered star field of small pale circles","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Roughly 190 tiny circles in #e6fffb with opacities 0.12-0.85 and radii 0.7-1.8 add texture to the upper sky without competing with foreground content."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_layered_mountain_silhouettes","label":"Layered mountain silhouettes (m1 and m2)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Two overlapping jagged paths filled with teal gradients supply atmospheric depth: a lighter far ridge and a darker near ridge."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_ground_mist_band","label":"Horizontal ground mist band","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"A 140-pixel tall mist gradient band at y=520 sits between the ridges and the field, separating the layers and reinforcing the night atmosphere."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_field_plane","label":"Receding field plane (field gradient)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"A curved green-to-dark path from y≈606 to the bottom of the frame forms the ground plane on which the perspective lines converge."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_perspective_light_paths","label":"Perspective light paths converging at a horizon vanishing point","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"About 53 quadratic strokes in #5eead4 fan outward from (960,610) toward the bottom edge with decreasing opacity and width, creating a strong one-point perspective glow that draws the eye to the center."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_near_field_grass_detail","label":"Near-field grass blade ellipses","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Hundreds of thin rotated ellipses in teal tones with opacity ~0.35-0.88 are scattered across the lower field, growing larger toward the bottom to imply foreground grass and depth."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_vignette_overlay","label":"Vignette overlay (vig radial gradient)","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"A final full-frame radial gradient darkens the edges by ~55% to focus attention on the center and improve contrast for overlaid login UI."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_calm_teal_palette","label":"Calm teal and dark navy palette","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"The repeated use of #5eead4, #2dd4bf, #14b8a6, #0d9488 and deep navy shades gives the app a calm, modern, nighttime identity suited to a login screen."},{"id":"leave_assets_login_bg_respite_rest_theme","label":"Respite and rest through a moonlit night landscape","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/home/danmarko/Downloads/Antigravity-x64/leave-system/leave-assets/login-bg.svg","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":nul